sg:卢植 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卢植"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "子干"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "身长八尺二寸，音声如钟。性刚毅有大节，常怀济世志，少与郑玄师从马融，通古今学，为当时大儒。著《尚书章句》、《三礼解诂》。州郡数辟，植皆不就。灵帝时，仕为博士，因才兼文武，拜庐江太守，还拜议郎。后任侍中，迁尚书。光和元年，上疏谏政，陈八..."@zh ;
    sg:novelDescription "卢植为汉末大儒，名望远闻于时。刘备曾经从师于他。黄巾起义，卢植奉命镇压，拒敌于广宗，未见胜负，因拒绝黄门左丰索要贿赂，而被诬陷罢职问罪。何进招董卓进京诛宦臣。卢植力谏，何进不听。于是辞官而去。董卓得政后，卢植又复职，谏阻董卓废陈留王立献帝。"@zh ;
    sg:master sg:刘备 ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:serves sg:董卓势力 ;
    sg:serves sg:袁绍势力 ;
    sg:holds <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#北中郎将%20尚书> ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:幽州涿郡涿 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第1回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第2回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第3回 .
sg:邓辅 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邓辅"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "鄧輔"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "逊遣将军李异、谢旌等将三千人，攻蜀将詹晏、陈凤。异将水军，旌将步兵，断绝险要，即破晏等，生降得凤。又攻房陵太守邓辅、南乡太守郭睦，大破之。秭归大姓文布、邓凯等合夷兵数千人，首尾西方。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:蜀 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:益州汉中郡房陵 .
sg:张白 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张白"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "張白"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "张温之弟，有才名。温以触怒孙权而废，白亦不为所用。"@zh ;
    sg:husband sg:陆郁生 ;
    sg:serves sg:吴 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:扬州吴郡吴 .
sg:祝奥 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "祝奥"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "祝奥"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "东汉末义军首领郭援的谋士。曾中贾逵之计，劝援缓攻皮氏七日，延误了战机。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:起义军 .
sg:荀衢 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀衢"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "荀衢"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "荀昙之子，荀攸叔父。昙卒，故吏张权求守墓，攸以为有奸，告衢。衢感悟，推问张权，果杀人亡命。衢由是对攸刮目相看。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:豫州颍川郡颍阳 .
sg:管邈 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "管邈"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "管邈"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "管宁之子。拜郎中，后为博士。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:青州北海国朱虚 .
sg:郤俭 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郤俭"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "郤儉"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "方士。传说能辟谷，食茯苓。绝食百日，而尚能行步起居自若云。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:豫州颍川郡 .
sg:王布 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王布"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "王布"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "寿春将王布示之马射，既而问之曰：“吴之君子亦能斯乎？”陟曰：“此军人骑士肄业所及，士大夫君子未有为之者矣。”布大惭。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:西晋 .
sg:陈正 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈正"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "陳正"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "孙权末年，任无难督。时孙权欲废太子孙和而立孙亮，上书谏止，遭族诛。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:吴 .
sg:王延 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王延"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "王延"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "王蕃弟。蕃死，孙皓迁蕃家属至广州。郭马反，延不为马用，被害。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:吴 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:扬州庐江郡 .
sg:李邵 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李邵"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "李邵"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "任冀州刺史。关东讨董卓兵起，他不从司马朗劝，徙居温县，使边山之民内徙后发生变乱。后任钜鹿太守，隶冀州牧袁绍。初平三年（192），袁绍与公孙瓒战于界桥（今河北威县东），他以公孙瓒兵强，欲附瓒。袁绍遂以董昭领钜鹿，去其职。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:司隶河内郡野王 .
sg:曹潜 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹潜"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "曹潜"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "魏王公。相殇王铄之子。青龙元年（233），潜嗣爵。其年卒，谥曰愍王。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:豫州沛国谯 .
sg:种邵 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "种邵"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "申甫"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "少知名。中平末为谏议大夫。献帝初从侍中出为益、涼二州刺史。会父死，不之职。与马腾等共攻李傕、郭汜，军败，邵等皆死。"@zh ;
    sg:novelDescription "西凉太守马腾、并州刺史韩遂，杀奔长安来，声言讨贼。李傕、郭汜用贾诩之计。恰好长安城中马宇家僮，出首家主与刘范、种邵外连马腾、韩遂，欲为内应等情。李傕、郭汜大怒，尽收三家老少良贱，斩于市，把三颗首级直来门前号令。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第10回 .
sg:毛甘 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "毛甘"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "毛甘"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "三国时歙县起义军首领，屯乌聊山，为吴将贺齐讨平。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:起义军 .
sg:郭缊 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭缊"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "郭緼"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "郭淮父，官至雁门太守。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:并州太原郡阳曲 ;
    sg:son sg:郭全 .
sg:沙末汗 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "沙末汗"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "沙末汗"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "东汉末鲜卑首领。建安中，其父厥机死，被曹操立为亲汉王。延康初，又遣使向曹魏献马。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:少数民族 .
sg:高承 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高承"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "高承"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "孙策部将。任五官掾。曾与奉正都尉刘由奉策命前往许昌，贡献方物。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:吴 .
sg:樊陵 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "樊陵"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "德云"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "祖樊英为安帝时学者、术士。初为永乐少府，后以谄事宦官，并纳货财，致为司徒、太尉，旋罢。灵帝中平六年（189），宦官张让、段珪发动宫廷政变，署陵为司隶校尉。未几，司隶校尉袁绍勒兵诛张、段二人，遂收陵斩之。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:荆州南阳郡鲁阳 .
sg:郭全 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭全"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "郭全"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "官至大司农。"@zh ;
    sg:father sg:郭缊 ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:并州太原郡阳曲 .
sg:陈奉 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈奉"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "陳奉"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "嘉禾三年（234），为校尉，随使者谢宏等至高句骊，拜句骊王宫为单于。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:吴 .
sg:育延 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "育延"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "育延"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "鲜卑大人。魏略曰：鲜卑大人育延，常为州所畏，而一旦将其部落五千余骑诣习，求互市。习念不听则恐其怨，若听到州下，又恐为所略，于是乃许之往与会空城中交市。遂敕郡县，自将治中以下军往就之。市易未毕，市吏收缚一胡。延骑皆惊，上马弯弓围习数重，..."@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:少数民族 .
sg:杜挚 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜挚"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "德鲁"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "善文赋。初为司徒军谋吏。后举孝廉，任郎中，转补校书。有集二卷，今佚。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:司隶河东郡闻喜 .
sg:陈应 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈应"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "陳應"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "虚构人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh ;
    sg:novelDescription "桂阳太守赵范的管军校尉，原为桂阳岒山乡猎戶出身，善使飞叉，与同是猎戶出身、曾射杀双虎的鲍隆皆自恃勇力，劝本欲降刘备的赵范出兵相拒，不过与赵云交锋便被生擒。赵云放陈应回桂阳，令其劝赵范投降。赵范降后因失言而自不安，欲反，与陈应、鲍隆商议..."@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:刘表势力 ;
    sg:holds sg:管军校尉 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第52回 .
sg:龚衡 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "龚衡"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "龔衡"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "景耀中为领军。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:蜀 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:益州巴郡安汉 .
sg:乌获 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "乌获"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "战国时秦国勇士。秦武王力大好戏耍，乌获等遂受宠。获与任鄙、孟说皆至大官。"@zh ;
    sg:novelDescription "战国时秦国勇士。秦武王力大好戏耍，乌获等遂受宠。获与任鄙、孟说皆至大官。演义中有提及此人。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:其他 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第22回 .
sg:卫固 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卫固"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "仲坚"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "初为河东郡掾。建安十年（205），并州刺史高干叛，张晟等应之。固亦起兵叛乱，以应高干。次年，曹操遣将平叛，斩固。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:司隶河东郡 .
sg:兀突骨 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "兀突骨"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "兀突骨"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "虚构人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh ;
    sg:novelDescription "南蛮乌戈国之主，是身长十二尺的巨汉。孟获遭到六擒六纵之後向兀突骨救援，兀突骨亲自带领两名兵长土安、奚泥及三万藤甲兵去攻蜀。在连胜魏延十五阵之後，追击至蟠蛇谷，被诸葛亮埋伏，以火攻反击之，兀突骨及其三万部下全部战死。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:少数民族 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:乌戈国 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第90回 .
sg:上官雝 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "上官雝"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "子修"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "行中典军讨虏将军。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:蜀 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:凉州天水郡 .
sg:郭敞 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭敞"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "泰中"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "郭嘉之孙。有才识，位散骑常侍。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:豫州颍川郡阳翟 .
sg:云英 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Female ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "云英"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "雲英"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "虚构人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh ;
    sg:novelDescription "董承的侍妾，因与董承家奴秦庆童有染被发现而受到杖脊四十，秦庆童怀恨在心，向曹操告发了董承的玉带诏密谋，导致董承被杀。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第23回 .
sg:狼岑 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "狼岑"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "狼岑"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "少数民族首领、豪户。槃木王舅舅。甚为蛮夷所信任，对蜀将张嶷进入定莋不满，拒不往见张嶷，被嶷收捕鞭死。嶷还尸其族，宣布岑罪，定莋遂服。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:少数民族 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:益州越巂郡定莋 .
sg:王坦之 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王坦之"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "文度"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "尚书令王述子。少时与郗超齐名。先后任侍中、中书令、丹杨尹、北中郎将，徐兖二州刺史等职。孝武帝宁康三年（375）卒，年四十六，追赠安北将军，谥曰献。坦之不重儒教，颇尚刑名学，著有《废莊论》等。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:西晋 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:并州太原郡晋阳 .
sg:何熙 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "何熙"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "孟孙"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "少有大志，不拘小节。永元中，举孝廉，为谒者，参拜殿中。和帝赞赏其威容，擢为御史中丞，历司隶校尉、大司农。永初三年（109），匈奴南单于和乌丸俱举兵反，以熙行车骑将军征之，累有功。暴病而卒。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:豫州陈国阳夏 .
sg:王威 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王威"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "王威"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "《汉晋春秋》载：荆将王威曾向刘琮献计道：「曹操得知将军（指刘琮）既降，刘备已走，必然解弛无备，轻行单进；若给我数千奇兵，于险地加以邀击，必可擒曹操。擒曹操即能威震天下，坐而虎步，中夏之地虽广，可传檄而定，这不只是收一胜之功以保守今日而..."@zh ;
    sg:novelDescription "乃忠义之士。刘备往荆州依附刘表时，蔡瑁深忌刘备，欲于宴会上构杀之，蒯越用计使王威与文聘调开赵云，使刘备几为所害。曾向刘琮献计道「将军既降，玄德已走，曹操必然懈弛无备；愿将军奋整奇兵，设于险处击之，操可获矣。获操则威震天下，中原虽广，可..."@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:刘表势力 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:益州广汉郡 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第34回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第41回 .
sg:审配 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "审配"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "正南"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "以正直不得志于韩馥，袁绍领冀州，被委以腹心之任，并总幕府。河北平定，袁绍以审配、逢纪统军事，配峙其强盛，力主与曹操决战。官渡战败，审配二子被俘，反因此受谮见疑。袁绍病死，审配等矫诏立袁尚为嗣，导致兄弟相争，被曹操各个击破。曹操围邺，审..."@zh ;
    sg:novelDescription "袁绍平定河北，正值徐州刘备求救，审配恃其强盛，力主兴兵讨曹，袁绍遂以审配、逢纪为统军，兵发黎阳。官渡对峙，审配献计起土山地道，使曹军皆蒙盾伏地。连战皆败，袁绍病死，审配等立袁尚为嗣，引发兄弟纷争，并屡劝袁尚攻击袁谭，致使谭困而投敌。曹..."@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:袁绍势力 ;
    sg:holds sg:治中 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:冀州魏郡 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第13回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第22回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第26回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第27回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第30回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第31回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第32回 .
sg:张泓 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张泓"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "張泓"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "西晋将领。武帝时为给事。赵王伦篡位，为征虏将军。齐王冏等举兵讨他，伦分兵拒之，以泓等拒冏。泓于势穷时降冏。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:西晋 .
sg:张礼 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张礼"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "張禮"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "为郡主记掾，甚得太守阴修赏识。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:豫州颍川郡 .
sg:朱志 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱志"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "朱志"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "赤乌中为牙门将。八年（245），与征西将军马茂等合谋欲收缚公卿诸将，引兵入苑中击孙权，叛吴降魏。事泄伏诛，夷三族。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:吴 .
sg:张氏 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Female ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张氏"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "張氏"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "张温中妹有节行，先适顾承，官以许嫁丁氏，成婚有日，饮药而死。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:吴 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:扬州吴郡吴 ;
    sg:mother sg:钟会 ;
    sg:wife sg:钟繇 .
sg:师宜官 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "师宜官"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "师宜官"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "书法家。汉灵帝好书法，世多能者，而师宜官为最。每书毕，辄削焚其稿。梁鹄灌醉宜官后窃其书札，临摹练习，曹操以为胜过宜官。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:荆州南阳郡 .
sg:和郁 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "和郁"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "和鬱"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "和峤同母弟。素无名，峤轻侮之。后郁以公强当世，致位尚书令。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:西晋 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:豫州汝南郡西平 ;
    sg:son sg:和逌 ;
    sg:brother sg:和峤 .
sg:董卓 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董卓"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "仲颖"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "早年为汉将，在西方平定少数民族叛乱，后来又参加讨伐黄巾起义，数次兵败，却依然升为前将军，掌管重兵。董卓拥兵自重，驻兵于河东，不肯接受朝廷的征召而放弃兵权，正逢京都大乱，何进被杀，董卓趁机进京，控制了中央政权。之后董卓废汉少帝，立汉献帝..."@zh ;
    sg:novelDescription "原为汉河东太守，征讨黄巾不利，却因贿赂十常侍官至西凉刺史。董卓应大将军何进之邀进京铲除宦官，恰逢何进被杀，于是收编何进部曲，又赠赤兔马给吕布，诱其投降并杀死荆州刺史丁原，从此不可一世。董卓废汉少帝，立汉献帝，朝臣多敢怒不敢言；董卓生性..."@zh ;
    sg:minister sg:刘协 ;
    sg:adoptive_father sg:吕布 ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:serves sg:董卓势力 ;
    sg:holds sg:太师 ;
    sg:holds sg:郿侯 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:凉州陇西郡临洮 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第1回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第2回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第3回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第4回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第5回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第6回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第7回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第8回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第9回 ;
