sg:夏侯湛 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯湛"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "孝若"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "夏侯渊之后。文章宏富，善构新词。美容貌。京都称其与潘岳为“连璧”。晋武帝泰始（265-274）中举贤良对策，中第，拜郎中。惠帝时为散骑常侍。性颇侈豪。著论三十余篇。元康（291-299）初卒。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:西晋 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:豫州沛国谯 .
sg:荀禹 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀禹"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "荀禹"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "任治书侍御史。黄初七年（226）孙权攻江夏郡，太守文聘坚守，禹被派往慰劳。禹至，于江夏发所经县兵及所从步骑千人乘山举火，孙权遂退走。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 .
sg:李贵人 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Female ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李贵人"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "李貴人"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "魏文帝曹丕夫人。生子曹协。黄初中，与郭后、阴贵人并受曹丕爱幸；致甄后遂有怨言而被赐死。"@zh ;
    sg:wife sg:曹丕 ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:mother sg:曹协 .
sg:隗渠 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "隗渠"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "隗渠"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "地方势力首领。苏祁邑君冬逢、逢弟隗渠等，已降复反。嶷诛逢。逢妻，旄牛王女，嶷以计原之。而渠逃入西徼。渠刚猛捷悍，为诸种深所畏惮，遣所亲二人诈降嶷，实取消息。嶷觉之，许以重赏，使为反间，二人遂合谋杀渠。渠死，诸种皆安。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:蜀 .
sg:许章 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "许章"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "許章"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "皇甫谧逸士传曰：汝南王儁，字子文，少为范滂、许章所识，与南阳岑晊善。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 .
sg:王图 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王图"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "王圖"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "领护军将军。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 .
sg:向雄 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "向雄"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "茂伯"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "初仕魏为郡主簿，事奉太守王经。及王经获罪处死，他哭丧而哀感市人。后以过失入狱，司隶校尉钟会从狱中辟为都官从事。及钟会以叛逆罪被杀，无人殡殓，他料理丧葬事宜。晋太康初为河南尹，赐爵关内侯。后为齐王司马攸归藩事，固谏忤旨，起而径出，不久因..."@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:西晋 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:司隶河内郡山阳 .
sg:李基 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李基"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "李基"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "李通之子。建安中，通死于军旅，基袭爵都亭侯。曹丕即位，诏拜奉义中郎降。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:nativePlace <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荆州江夏郡[魏]平春> .
sg:曹上 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹上"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "曹上"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "曹操之子，早卒。魏太和五年（231），追封谥曰临邑殇公子。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:豫州沛国谯 ;
    sg:son sg:曹操 ;
    sg:brother sg:曹玹 .
sg:李祯 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李祯"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "李禎"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "与李傕同乡里，二人素通好。献帝时，任侍中。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:凉州北地郡 .
sg:王弼 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王弼"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "辅嗣"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "为正始玄学奠基人之一。十几岁时才华就被当时的大家发现受到推崇，与同时的钟会齐名。有着天才般的哲学思辨能力，但是不善于处理社会事务，何晏曾将之推荐给曹爽，却因为不切实际而不得到赏识。高平陵事变之后的秋天因病去世。生前构建过魏晋玄学的基础..."@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:holds sg:尚书郎 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:兖州山阳郡 .
sg:潘凤 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "潘凤"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "潘鳳"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "虚构人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh ;
    sg:novelDescription "冀州刺史韩馥麾下上将。汜水关之戰中，韩馥曰：“吾有上将潘凤，可斩华雄。”绍急令出战。潘凤手提大斧上马。去不多时，飞马来报：“潘凤又被华雄斩了。”众皆失色。 "@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:holds sg:将军 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第5回 .
sg:陈術 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈術"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "申伯"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "博学多闻，著《释问》七篇、《益部耆旧传》及《志》，位历三郡太守。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:蜀 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:益州汉中郡 .
sg:王晨 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王晨"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "王晨"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "王淩叔父允，为汉司徒，诛董卓。卓将李傕、郭汜等为卓报仇，入长安，杀允，尽害其家。凌及兄晨，时年皆少，逾城得脱，亡命归乡里。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 .
sg:敬怀皇后 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Female ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "敬怀皇后"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "敬懷皇后"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "孙权妻。孙休母。王氏被选入宫，到嘉禾年间得到孙权宠幸，并且诞下六子孙休。赤乌五年(242年)，孙权立孙和为太子，因孙和之母王夫人尊贵，宫中所有曾被孙权宠幸的女子，都要离宫居住，于是王氏被迁居至公安。后来逝世并下葬。会稽王太平三年(25..."@zh ;
    sg:wife sg:孙权 ;
    sg:serves sg:吴 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:荆州南阳郡 .
sg:顾雍 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "顾雍"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "元叹"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "弱冠为合肥长，后历任数县，所在多有治绩。孙权掌权后，任命他为会稽郡丞，行太守事，后不断升迁，成为吴国第二任丞相。顾雍为人严肃，不饮酒，少言语，自孙权上下对其多有忌惮。顾雍为相十九年，多进良言，有功于吴，后病逝，孙权亲自临吊，谥曰肃侯。"@zh ;
    sg:novelDescription "顾雍，蔡邕之徒。其为人少言语，不饮酒，严厉正大，被张纮推荐仕于孙权。孙权任命他为会稽郡丞，行太守事，后不断升迁，官至吴国丞相。顾雍为官，多进良言，有功于吴。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:吴 ;
    sg:holds sg:丞相 ;
    sg:holds sg:醴陵侯 ;
    sg:holds sg:平尚书事 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:扬州吴郡吴 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第29回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第38回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第43回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第44回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第56回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第61回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第65回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第68回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第73回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第82回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第83回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第86回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第96回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第98回 .
sg:贾玑 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "贾玑"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "賈玑"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "贾诩之子，魏驸马都尉、关内侯，后徙居长乐。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:凉州武威郡姑臧 .
sg:王粲 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王粲"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "仲宣"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "“建安七子”之一。著名文学家。其祖为汉朝三公。献帝西迁时，王粲徙至长安，左中郎将蔡邕见而奇之。后到荆州依附刘表。刘表以王粲其人貌不副其名而且躯体羸弱，不甚见重。刘表死后。王粲劝刘表次子刘琮，令归降于曹操。曹操辟王粲为丞相掾，赐爵关内侯..."@zh ;
    sg:novelDescription "幼时往见左中郎将蔡邕，蔡邕见而奇之，倒屣以相迎。王粲强记默识，善算术行文；一次与友人共行，读道边石碑，观一遍而背诵之，不失一字。又曾观人下围棋，其局乱，王粲复为重置，不误一道。后到荆州依附刘表，刘表以其为上宾。刘表死后，王粲劝刘表次子..."@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:刘表势力 ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:holds sg:侍中 ;
    sg:nativePlace <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#兖州山阳郡高平[山阳郡]> ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第40回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第41回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第56回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第66回 .
sg:孙兴 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙兴"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "孫興"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "平南将军孙辅之子。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:吴 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:扬州吴郡富春 .
sg:苏衡 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苏衡"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "蘇衡"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "酒泉苏衡反，与羌豪邻戴及丁令胡万余骑攻边县。既与夏侯儒击破之，衡及邻戴等皆降。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:凉州酒泉郡 .
sg:仇昭仪 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Female ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "仇昭仪"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "仇昭儀"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "魏文帝曹丕夫人。生东海定王霖。"@zh ;
    sg:wife sg:曹丕 ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 .
sg:杨虑 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨虑"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "威方"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "少有德行，为江南冠冕。州郡礼召，诸公辟请，皆不能屈。年十七，夭，乡人号曰德行杨君。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:在野 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:荆州南郡襄阳 .
sg:路粹 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "路粹"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "文蔚"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "少学于蔡邕。建安初拜为尚书郎，后为军谋祭酒，典记室。孔融有过，曹操使粹为奏，融诛。人无不畏其笔，转秘书令，坐违禁诛。"@zh ;
    sg:novelDescription "孔融在推荐祢衡的表中提及了此人。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:兖州陈留郡 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第23回 .
sg:于兹 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "于兹"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "于兹"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "下邳相笮融部将。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 .
sg:王翁 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王翁"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "王翁"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "王基的叔父。基少孤与叔父翁居。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:青州东莱郡曲成 .
sg:霍显 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Female ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "霍显"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "霍顯"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "魏明帝青龙元年（233），并州刺史毕轨送汉故度辽将军范明友鲜卑奴。此奴年三百五十岁，言语饮食如常人，自言名霍显，乃霍光后小妻。又言明友妻为霍光前妻女。"@zh ;
    sg:wife sg:霍光 ;
    sg:serves sg:在野 .
sg:时苗 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "时苗"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "德胄"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "以时清白。建安中入丞相府，出为寿春令。官至典农中郎将。因节操清峻，故《魏略》把他和常林、吉茂、沐并四人列入《清介传》。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:冀州巨鹿郡 .
sg:车浚 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "车浚"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "車浚"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "末主孙皓时，任会稽太守。天玺元年（276），以不出算缗钱，为孙皓斩，并传首诸郡示众。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:吴 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:荆州桂阳郡南平 .
sg:贾龙 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "贾龙"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "賈龍"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "益州牧刘焉之校尉。马相自称“天子”，众至十余万人，遣兵破巴郡，杀郡守赵部。州从事贾龙，先领兵数百人在犍为，遂纠合吏人攻相，破之，龙乃遣吏卒迎焉。焉到，以龙为校尉，徙居绵竹。焉欲立威刑以自尊大，乃托以佗事，杀州中豪强十余人，士民皆怨。犍..."@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:serves sg:刘焉 ;
    sg:holds sg:校尉 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:益州蜀郡 .
sg:韩晞 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩晞"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "韓晞"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "孙策攻黄祖，表遣从子刘虎及晞率长矛军五千救黄祖。及与孙策战，败，被杀。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:刘表势力 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:荆州南阳郡 .
sg:高顺 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高顺"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "高順"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "东汉末吕布部将。清白威严，骁勇有智，衷心仁义。不饮酒，不受馈遗。每谏布：“以智者、慎思而行”。布知其忠，然不能用。后郝萌反，更疏之。顺所将七百馀兵，号为千人，铠甲斗具皆精练齐整，每所攻击无不破者，名为陷陈营。以魏续有外内之亲，悉夺顺所..."@zh ;
    sg:novelDescription "高顺是吕布手下的骁勇战将，号称陷陈营。随吕布奔波征战，劳苦奋命而又忠心耿耿。下邳城破，高顺为曹操所俘，不降被曹操处斩。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第11回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第12回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第14回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第15回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第16回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第17回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第18回 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第19回 ;
    sg:minister sg:吕布 .
sg:郭统 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭统"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "郭統"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "郭淮之子。淮卒，统嗣侯。官至荆州刺史。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:并州太原郡阳曲 .
sg:纪瞻 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "纪瞻"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "思远"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "纪孚弟，在晋国担任骠骑将军。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:西晋 .
sg:张逸 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张逸"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "張逸"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "常山相掾属。刘虞为公孙瓒谋杀后，逸与常山相孙瑾等忠义愤发，至虞被害处指斥公孙瓒，而为其所杀。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 .
sg:贾琮 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "贾琮"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "孟坚"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "举孝廉，迁为京兆尹，有政绩。中平元年（184）为交阯刺史，安民除害，在事三年，征拜议郎。又为冀州刺史、度辽将军，卒于官。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:兖州东郡聊城 .
sg:杨俊 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨俊"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "季才"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "曹操任之为安陵令，又迁为南阳太守。俊宣德教、立学校、吏民称之。魏国既建，迁中尉。他自少及长，以人伦自任。黄初三年（222），文帝至宛，以市不丰乐，发怒收俊，遂自杀。众冤痛之。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:魏 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:司隶河内郡获嘉 .
sg:刘本 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘本"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "劉本"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "学者。师受经传，博学群书。举贤良方正，为般长，卒于官。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 .
sg:魏延 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "魏延"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "文长"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "征西大将军、前军师、凉州刺史。以部曲随刘备入蜀，数有战功，迁牙门将军。刘备为汉中王，欲以重将镇汉川，众论以为必是张飞，张飞亦以心自许，结果拔魏延为督汉中镇远将军、领汉中太守，全军尽惊。诸葛亮驻汉中，以魏延为督前部，领丞相司马、凉州刺史..."@zh ;
    sg:novelDescription "相貌与关羽极为相似。初从荆州刺史刘表，表卒，次子琮嗣。蔡瑁专权，献州降曹公。先主引军民投襄阳，瑁等乱箭射下。城外百姓，皆望敌楼而哭。延引数百人径上城楼，轮刀砍死守门将士，开了城门。文聘遂与之大战，从已至未，手下兵卒皆已折尽。延乃拨马而..."@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:蜀 ;
    sg:holds sg:征西大将军 ;
    sg:holds sg:前军师 ;
    sg:holds sg:凉州刺史 ;
    sg:holds sg:假节 ;
    sg:holds sg:南郑侯 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:扬州庐江郡义阳 ;
