sg:张慕 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张慕"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "張慕"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "建兴五年（227），诸葛亮北往汉中，慕聚众钞盗军资，劫掠吏民，为张嶷所斩。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:蜀 .
sg:许钦 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "许钦"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "許欽"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "靖虽年逾七十，爱乐人物，诱纳后进，清谈不倦。丞相诸葛亮皆为之拜。章武二年卒。子钦，先靖夭没。钦子游，景耀中为尚书。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:蜀 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:豫州汝南郡平舆 .
sg:柴玉 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "柴玉"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "柴玉"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "东汉末三国初技工。在汉为铸钟工，意巧有思，形器之中，多所造作。曹操时曾取所铸钟，杂错更试，以为不如法，罪玉为养马士。文帝时又见信用。"@zh ;
    sg:serves sg:在野 .
sg:袁胤 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> sg:Male ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁胤"@zh ;
    sg:courtesyName "袁胤"@zh ;
    sg:historicity "史实人物"@zh ;
    sg:historicalDescription "丹"@zh ;
    sg:brother sg:袁绍 ;
    sg:serves sg:东汉 ;
    sg:serves sg:袁术势力 ;
    sg:holds sg:丹杨太守 ;
    sg:nativePlace sg:豫州汝南郡汝阳 ;
    sg:appearsIn sg:第21回 .
